{"id":"64a7e9a3e5d98c15","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-primitive-class.md","title":"Primitive Class","display":"df-primitive-class — Primitive Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-primitive-class","aliases":["93-df-primitive-class"],"display":"df-primitive-class — Primitive Class","depends_on":["[[93-df-variety]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-primitive-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-primitive-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-class — Primitive Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> is a class candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\\)</span> is the variety predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prim}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prim}_{93}\\)</span> is the classical universal-algebra predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prim}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prim}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“Primitive class” is used here in its classical universal-algebra sense: a class axiomatized by identities, hence a variety.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}$ is the variety predicate of [[93-df-variety]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prim}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prim}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)","display":true}],"bytes":799,"backlinks":[{"id":"171fc1f7452c6f4d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prim}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{HSP}$ have the signatures fixed in [[93-df-primitive-class]] and [[93-df-closure-operators]]."}],"outgoing":["f0b0edbaa6696a1d"]}